<Legal title="Disclosures" tab="disclosures" path="/legal/disclosures">
  <h2>Investing carries risk</h2>
  <p>Investing in equities on the Pakistan Stock Exchange carries risk, including the partial or total loss of your capital. Prices can fall as well as rise, and can move sharply.</p>

  <h2>Not advice</h2>
  <p>{site.name} provides educational research and analytics only. It does not provide personalised investment advice, and nothing here should be taken as a recommendation to buy, sell or hold any security.</p>

  <h2>Past performance</h2>
  <p>Any historical figures, backtests or scored records shown on {site.name} describe the past. Past performance does not predict or guarantee future results, and the desk's own scored record includes losses.</p>

  <h2>Illustrations</h2>
  <p>Panels on this site marked as illustrations show the layout of the product, not live figures or actual calls. Real figures are computed inside the desk from its data layer.</p>

  <h2>Data</h2>
  <p>Market data may be delayed and may contain errors. Always confirm prices and corporate actions with your broker before acting.</p>

  <h2>Your responsibility</h2>
  <p>All investment decisions are yours alone. Consider taking independent, licensed financial advice suited to your circumstances.</p>
</Legal>
